# Patch files must be checked out byte-for-byte. On Windows runners the
# default autocrlf LF->CRLF translation corrupts git-apply headers and
# binary patches (0009/0010 icons) -> "git diff header lacks filename
# information". -text disables any EOL conversion for these.
*.patch -text
*.input -text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.pl -text
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
